! Human-maintained source note.
!
! The executable lexc is generated at fst/generated/verbs.lexc from:
!   - data/lexicon/verbs.tsv        abstract roots and contextual VIs
!   - fst/src/book_rules.tsv        chapter-backed terminal/Vocabulary rules
!
! scripts/generate_lexc.py expands those rules into finite lexical/surface
! paths.  Keeping the expansion generated prevents 351 source verbs from
! being copied into a hand-maintained continuation-class lexicon.
